WEBVTT

00:00:04.215 --> 00:00:04.751
Hi there!

00:00:04.751 --> 00:00:09.637
In this video, I'll show you how to pull
a guest order link from your Client Admin

00:00:09.637 --> 00:00:15.024
Dashboard, so you can share it with
anyone who needs to place a guest order.

00:00:15.024 --> 00:00:19.705
Start on Weekly Snapshot and choose
your location using the Programs filter.

00:00:19.705 --> 00:00:24.813
If you have more than one location,
pick the one you want to look at.

00:00:24.813 --> 00:00:28.887
Below that, the calendar shows
every order across your locations.

00:00:28.887 --> 00:00:31.751
Find the day you're looking for.

00:00:31.751 --> 00:00:35.180
Click the order to open it,
then click Copy Guest Link.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.672
You'll see a confirmation
that the link has been copied,

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:42.960
and you can paste it into an
email or message to share.

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.921
Guest order links are
specific to each day of the

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.579
week, so you'll copy a
new one for each day.

00:00:48.579 --> 00:00:53.848
Guests will be asked to enter their
name and email before they can order.

00:00:53.848 --> 00:00:57.490
If you'd like to limit guest
access to certain email domains,

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:01.549
reach out to your Client Success
Manager and they'll help you set it

00:01:01.549 --> 00:01:02.583
up.

00:01:02.583 --> 00:01:03.443
And that's it!

00:01:03.443 --> 00:01:08.234
Choose your location, open the order on
the calendar, and copy the guest link.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.463
Thanks for watching!
